{"nodes":[{"id":"d75ae21741a94d91","type":"group","label":"可觀察異常（同時支撐「表象破綻」與「實質存在」）","x":8,"y":8,"width":683,"height":1443},{"id":"891803f5f7adc05c","type":"group","label":"系統架構（部件）","x":8,"y":2298,"width":1058,"height":391},{"id":"15b656be28fbb5d6","type":"group","label":"表象／實質（成對同顯）","x":383,"y":1459,"width":1058,"height":831},{"id":"5186bc0ea43fc2f8","type":"text","text":"**星羅懂得法術基本原理**\n\n印度洋王國禁止公主學習法術，星羅必然在其他地方學過 → 支撐「並非天生神使／曾為普通人魚」","x":407,"y":423,"width":260,"height":172,"color":"#2563EB"},{"id":"0a939aed345c6821","type":"text","text":"**星羅誕生時已是兒童**\n\n一般公主誕生時都是嬰兒 → 支撐「成為公主前另有階段」","x":407,"y":667,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#2563EB"},{"id":"e9baaed89451eeb3","type":"text","text":"**星羅認知異於其他公主**\n\n通曉人類語言與社會，對印度洋王國生活印象模糊","x":407,"y":863,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#2563EB"},{"id":"482c117f795e8faa","type":"text","text":"**星羅與Kafziel的特殊連結**\n\n在Kafziel身上找到「哥哥」的感覺","x":407,"y":1059,"width":260,"height":148,"color":"#2563EB"},{"id":"1c7f7584582c8a41","type":"text","text":"**公主無法使用法術**\n\n王國教導如此，具體原因不明","x":407,"y":55,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#2563EB"},{"id":"08e03da1440c9621","type":"text","text":"**諾愛爾成功強行施放法術**\n\n與「無法施法」的制度說法衝突，指向仍保有法力系統","x":407,"y":227,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#2563EB"},{"id":"5924591745027934","type":"text","text":"**珍珠指向不受主觀認知影響**\n\n指向對象不受人魚公主主觀認知影響 → 支撐「判斷在珍珠／執行端」","x":407,"y":1279,"width":260,"height":148,"color":"#2563EB"},{"id":"f20632a9cf00907e","type":"text","text":"**歌曲中存在流行曲**\n\n海之女神「給予」的歌曲裡有流行曲 → 支撐「非女神賜予」","x":32,"y":1107,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#2563EB"},{"id":"6dd844affa5a46d3","type":"text","text":"**歌曲實際由阿拉拉創作**\n\n公主所唱的歌曲實際由阿拉拉創作","x":32,"y":1303,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#2563EB"},{"id":"cbf0e8d873c80cdb","type":"text","text":"**海之主**\n\n開發星降神臨，用以控制星球防禦系統","x":32,"y":2541,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#16A34A"},{"id":"dfde8498c544cdb9","type":"text","text":"**星降神臨**\n\n星球級系統；核心功能含基質收集、干擾粒子、位置回報與容器回收","x":407,"y":2345,"width":260,"height":148,"color":"#16A34A"},{"id":"066c3977db9fcf4e","type":"text","text":"**海之女神**\n\n系統管理終端的中繼載體","x":782,"y":2417,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#16A34A"},{"id":"5b72d1dea4204233","type":"text","text":"**珍珠**\n\n系統執行端；離開貝殼時會自動向特定對象釋放能量","x":782,"y":2541,"width":260,"height":124,"color":"#16A34A"},{"id":"3c00064bc669389b","type":"text","text":"**阿拉拉與長老輸入**\n\n歌曲由阿拉拉創作、長老輸入系統","x":32,"y":2417,"width":260,"height":100,"color":"#16A34A"},{"id":"38431af04a4519ae","type":"text","text":"**天降神使／基質容器**\n\n表象：人魚公主是天降神使；實質：基質容器＋干擾粒子製造器，經身體改造與家庭抹除後包裝為神使","x":782,"y":1506,"width":260,"height":196,"color":"#16A34A"},{"id":"394bf5825f1a348b","type":"text","text":"**歌聲珍珠守護／干擾開關**\n\n表象：公主以歌聲與珍珠守護和平；實質：變身或使用珍珠時系統暫停干擾（干擾開關）","x":407,"y":1750,"width":260,"height":196,"color":"#16A34A"},{"id":"a92b2d5d65775103","type":"text","text":"**長老輔佐／系統維護者**\n\n表象：長老輔佐並保護公主；實質：長老是系統維護者","x":407,"y":1974,"width":260,"height":148,"color":"#16A34A"},{"id":"b8e4c1f2a9d03e7a","type":"text","text":"**失蹤無力追查／位置回報**\n\n表象：公主失蹤是無力追查；實質：系統持續回報公主位置","x":782,"y":1750,"width":260,"height":148,"color":"#16A34A"},{"id":"c1d9e8f4b2a56c3e","type":"text","text":"**星盡神聖處罰／容器回收**\n\n表象：星盡是違規後的神聖處罰；實質：容器報廢與回收程序","x":782,"y":1926,"width":260,"height":148,"color":"#16A34A"},{"id":"2873cefe71551eea","type":"text","text":"**女神給予神曲／人造輸入曲**\n\n表象：歌曲由海之女神「給予」；實質：阿拉拉創作、長老輸入系統的人造曲目","x":407,"y":1506,"width":260,"height":196,"color":"#16A34A"},{"id":"d4e7f1a8c9b02d5f","type":"text","text":"**干擾感知／干擾粒子**\n\n表象：公主存在會影響感知、變身能量遠超常人；實質：平常在散播干擾粒子，變身放大釋放","x":782,"y":2102,"width":260,"height":172,"color":"#16A34A"}],"edges":[{"id":"e1","fromNode":"cbf0e8d873c80cdb","fromSide":"right","toNode":"dfde8498c544cdb9","toSide":"left","color":"#1F2937","label":"推導"},{"id":"e2","fromNode":"dfde8498c544cdb9","fromSide":"right","toNode":"066c3977db9fcf4e","toSide":"left","color":"#94A3B8","label":"屬於","toEnd":"none"},{"id":"e3","fromNode":"dfde8498c544cdb9","fromSide":"right","toNode":"5b72d1dea4204233","toSide":"left","color":"#94A3B8","label":"屬於","toEnd":"none"},{"id":"e4","fromNode":"dfde8498c544cdb9","fromSide":"top","toNode":"38431af04a4519ae","toSide":"bottom","color":"#94A3B8","label":"屬於","toEnd":"none"},{"id":"e5","fromNode":"dfde8498c544cdb9","fromSide":"top","toNode":"a92b2d5d65775103","toSide":"bottom","color":"#94A3B8","label":"屬於","toEnd":"none"},{"id":"e6","fromNode":"dfde8498c544cdb9","fromSide":"top","toNode":"b8e4c1f2a9d03e7a","toSide":"bottom","color":"#94A3B8","label":"屬於","toEnd":"none"},{"id":"e7","fromNode":"dfde8498c544cdb9","fromSide":"top","toNode":"c1d9e8f4b2a56c3e","toSide":"bottom","color":"#94A3B8","label":"屬於","toEnd":"none"},{"id":"e8","fromNode":"38431af04a4519ae","fromSide":"left","toNode":"394bf5825f1a348b","toSide":"right","color":"#94A3B8","label":"屬於","toEnd":"none"},{"id":"e9","fromNode":"38431af04a4519ae","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"d4e7f1a8c9b02d5f","toSide":"top","color":"#94A3B8","label":"屬於","toEnd":"none"},{"id":"e10","fromNode":"3c00064bc669389b","fromSide":"top","toNode":"2873cefe71551eea","toSide":"bottom","color":"#94A3B8","label":"屬於","toEnd":"none"},{"id":"e11","fromNode":"5186bc0ea43fc2f8","fromSide":"right","toNode":"38431af04a4519ae","toSide":"top","color":"#1F2937","label":"支持"},{"id":"e12","fromNode":"0a939aed345c6821","fromSide":"right","toNode":"38431af04a4519ae","toSide":"top","color":"#1F2937","label":"支持"},{"id":"e13","fromNode":"e9baaed89451eeb3","fromSide":"right","toNode":"38431af04a4519ae","toSide":"right","color":"#1F2937","label":"支持"},{"id":"e14","fromNode":"482c117f795e8faa","fromSide":"right","toNode":"38431af04a4519ae","toSide":"right","color":"#1F2937","label":"支持"},{"id":"e15","fromNode":"1c7f7584582c8a41","fromSide":"right","toNode":"38431af04a4519ae","toSide":"top","color":"#1F2937","label":"支持"},{"id":"e16","fromNode":"08e03da1440c9621","fromSide":"right","toNode":"38431af04a4519ae","toSide":"top","color":"#1F2937","label":"支持"},{"id":"e17","fromNode":"5924591745027934","fromSide":"left","toNode":"066c3977db9fcf4e","toSide":"bottom","color":"#1F2937","label":"支持"},{"id":"e18","fromNode":"f20632a9cf00907e","fromSide":"right","toNode":"2873cefe71551eea","toSide":"left","color":"#1F2937","label":"支持"},{"id":"e19","fromNode":"6dd844affa5a46d3","fromSide":"right","toNode":"2873cefe71551eea","toSide":"left","color":"#1F2937","label":"支持"}]}